---
---

<section class="py-24 bg-dark-bg text-white relative overflow-hidden">
  
  <div class="absolute right-0 top-1/4 grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 opacity-5">
    {Array(20).fill(0).map(() => <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-white rounded-full"></div>)}
  </div>

  <div class="container mx-auto max-w-7xl px-8 lg:px-20 relative z-10">
    <div class="flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center gap-16 lg:gap-24">
      
      <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 relative">
        <div class="relative rounded-[2rem] overflow-hidden border border-gray-700 shadow-2xl">
          <img 
            src="/img/quienes-somos.webp" 
            alt="Electricista profesional Dimix"
            width="800"
            height="800"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
            class="w-full h-full object-cover grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all duration-700"
          />
          
          <div class="absolute bottom-6 right-6 bg-accent p-6 rounded-xl shadow-lg max-w-[160px] text-center">
            <i class="ti ti-award text-4xl text-white mb-2 block"></i>
            <span class="block text-3xl font-display font-bold leading-none">15+</span>
            <span class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mt-1">Años de Experiencia</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="w-full lg:w-1/2 space-y-8">
        
        <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
          <span class="w-8 h-0.5 bg-accent"></span>
          <span class="text-accent font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-sm">Quiénes Somos</span>
        </div>

        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-display font-bold leading-tight">
          PROFESIONALES DE <br />
          CONFIANZA DESDE HACE <br />
          <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-white to-gray-500">UNA DÉCADA</span>
        </h2>

        <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg leading-relaxed font-sans">
          En Dimix Soluciones, no solo arreglamos cables; garantizamos tu tranquilidad. 
          Nuestro equipo de electricistas autorizados combina experiencia técnica con un servicio al cliente excepcional.
        </p>

        <ul class="space-y-4 text-gray-300">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <i class="ti ti-circle-check-filled text-accent text-xl"></i>
            <span>Presupuestos cerrados, sin sorpresas.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <i class="ti ti-circle-check-filled text-accent text-xl"></i>
            <span>Cumplimiento estricto normativa REBT.</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <i class="ti ti-circle-check-filled text-accent text-xl"></i>
            <span>Atención rápida en todo Madrid.</span>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <div class="pt-4">
          <a href="/empresa" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-white text-dark-bg px-8 py-4 rounded-full font-bold hover:bg-gray-200 transition-colors">
            Conoce al equipo
            <i class="ti ti-arrow-right"></i>
          </a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-24 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 border-t border-gray-800 pt-12 text-center md:text-left">
      
      <div>
        <span class="block text-4xl md:text-5xl font-display font-bold text-white mb-2">20+</span>
        <span class="text-gray-500 font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-sm">Certificaciones Oficiales</span>
      </div>

      <div>
        <span class="block text-4xl md:text-5xl font-display font-bold text-white mb-2">6,000+</span>
        <span class="text-gray-500 font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-sm">Trabajos Completados</span>
      </div>

      <div>
        <span class="block text-4xl md:text-5xl font-display font-bold text-white mb-2">24/7</span>
        <span class="text-gray-500 font-medium uppercase tracking-wider text-sm">Disponibilidad Urgente</span>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>